#: src/window.rs:1001
#, rust-format
msgid "{model} knows {lang} only, so every dictation is in {lang}."
msgstr ""
"{model}은(는) {lang}만 지원하므로 모든 받아쓰기가 {lang}(으)로 처리됩니다."

#. Translators: no model, as the default model of a keyboard language.
